{"D:\\wt\\ssimple5\\vlog\\ssimple5\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "This is my mother's furoshiki, a square of blue cotton cloth she carried for 60 years. With this one cloth she never needed a shopping bag, a gift box or a roll of wrapping paper. She lived to 101 in Osaka. After 60, she stopped buying nine things, one by one, and she never missed any of them. Today I will tell you all nine. And number nine is the one that kept her comfortable for forty years on a very small pension when many of her friends were worried every month. One of them she replaced with a big kettle and a handful of roasted barley. Another one she replaced with a square of old cotton cut from my father's shirts. But first one honest thing. This is not advice from a bank and I am not telling you how to spend your money. This is just how one old woman in Osaka lived, simple and happy, and I am seventy-nine now, and I do every one of these nine things.", "words": [{"w": " This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.22}, {"w": " is", "s": 0.22, "e": 0.44}, {"w": " my", "s": 0.44, "e": 0.56}, {"w": " mother's", "s": 0.56, "e": 1.08}, {"w": " furoshiki,", "s": 1.08, "e": 1.72}, {"w": " a", "s": 1.72, "e": 2.32}, {"w": " square", "s": 2.32, "e": 2.7}, {"w": " of", "s": 2.7, "e": 2.9}, {"w": " blue", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.18}, {"w": " cotton", "s": 3.18, "e": 3.6}, {"w": " cloth", "s": 3.6, "e": 4.0}, {"w": " she", "s": 4.0, "e": 4.22}, {"w": " carried", "s": 4.22, "e": 4.56}, {"w": " for", "s": 4.56, "e": 4.8}, {"w": " 60", "s": 4.8, "e": 5.28}, {"w": " years.", "s": 5.28, "e": 6.34}, {"w": " With", "s": 5.94, "e": 6.5}, {"w": " this", "s": 6.5, "e": 6.78}, {"w": " one", "s": 6.78, "e": 7.0}, {"w": " cloth", "s": 7.0, "e": 7.36}, {"w": " she", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.56}, {"w": " never", "s": 7.56, "e": 7.92}, {"w": " needed", "s": 7.92, "e": 8.24}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.24, "e": 8.4}, {"w": " shopping", "s": 8.4, "e": 8.78}, {"w": " bag,", "s": 8.78, "e": 9.52}, {"w": " a", "s": 9.52, "e": 9.66}, {"w": " gift", "s": 9.66, "e": 10.02